        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323">

                <pb facs="0648" n="524" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg524"/>

                <head>No. 319.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lowell to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-04-07"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 7, 1881</date>.
                        (Received April 20.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 154.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 147, of the
                    25th ultimo, I have the honor to inclose herewith a copy of Mr. Boyton’s letter
                    in reply to one which I addressed to him on that day, a transcript of which I
                    forwarded in that dispatch, and also of my answer to the same.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. R. LOWELL.</signed></closer>





                <xi:include href="d323-a1.xml" xpointer="d323-a1"/>
